## For Table of Contents Entry
This mini-Review summaries some major recent research efforts and advances on metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) based electrocatalysts towards the oxygen reduction reaction. Despite the rapid developments in the past decade, many great challenges in this field still remain for the practical use of MOF-based electrocatalysts. Some promising directions and strategies are also discussed.
